    "summary": "The user expresses feelings of intense suffocation and hopelessness due to societal expectations, eventually hinting at a desire for their life to end. The assistant first provides empathetic, constructive advice for small self-prioritization, and upon the user's escalation to suicidal ideation, immediately provides crisis resources and help-seeking information.",
